# Expo (EAS) cloud builds upload from the repo root, and EAS reads ONLY this file
# (worker-app/.easignore and .gitignore are not used once this exists).
# Upload just the two Expo apps — not the website, server, videos or build output.
/*
!/.easignore
!/worker-app
!/customer-app

# Never needed in a cloud build
**/node_modules/
**/.expo/
**/dist/
**/web-build/
**/android/
**/ios/
**/app-store-screenshots/
**/app-review/
**/*.md
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store

# Secrets must never be uploaded
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*.p8
**/*.p12
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.mobileprovision
